  offerLine: '*rubs hind legs* My trunk is full of holes. Four bark and two silk would fix it. I''ll give you a scrap I found inside.'
  activeLine: Four bark, two silk. Kea is good at finding bark.
  readyLine: Snug again! Here, take this scrap. And my friend Spider wants to go foraging with you.
  doneLine: Come by at night. I'm awake then.
